(text "ch1–3 injector choke part selection is complete; final DC drop, thermal rise, RF impedance and footprint\nqualification remain open. Optional L407 DNP.\nВорота (стенд): Verify selected 0805LS-471XGRC / 0805HP-221XGRC / 0603HP-47NXGRW manufacturer land patterns\nand target-band impedance under bias. VNA qualify IL/RL/isolation and DC heating at actual/worst protected\ncurrent. The current Coilcraft 0603HP PDF confirms the 2.3 GHz typical SRF; no documentary SRF question\nremains. Optional L407 (candidate 0805CS-471XGRC, SRF 375 MHz read on DigiKey; Q at 162 MHz not read) stays\nDNP until separately qualified; L401 is removed (P1 pigtail into A401)." (at 13.97 38.93 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid f86c79e9-c486-57c8-b6a2-68d792604aaf))
